{"corpus":"ccc","number":713,"text_html":"<span>Les traits du Messie sont révélés surtout dans les chants du Serviteur <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup>. Ces chants annoncent le sens<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§601</sup> de la passion de Jésus, et indiquent ainsi la manière dont Il répandra l’Esprit Saint pour vivifier la multitude : non pas de l’extérieur, mais en épousant notre « condition d’esclave » <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"9\">2</sup>. Prenant sur lui notre mort, il peut nous communiquer son propre Esprit de vie.</span>","cross_refs":["601"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Is 42:1-9"},{"text":"Mt 12:18-21"},{"text":"Jn 1:32-34"},{"text":"Is 49:16"},{"text":"Mt 3:17"},{"text":"Lc 2:32"},{"text":"Is 50:4-10"},{"text":"Is 52:13"},{"text":"Is 53:12"},{"text":"Ph 2:7"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Is 42:1-9","idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 12:18-21","idx":2,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"Jn 1:32-34 , puis Is 49:16","idx":3,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 3:17","idx":4,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"Lc 2:32","idx":5,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"enfin Is 50:4-10","idx":6,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"52:13","idx":7,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"53:12","idx":8,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"Ph 2:7","idx":9,"display_idx":2}]}